  "terms_section1_title": "1. Kwetaba mu Mateeka",
  "terms_section1_body": "Okozesa app ya Da-Costa, okiriziganya okuweebwa amateeka gano. Bw'oba tokiriziganya, tokozesa app.",
  "terms_section2_title": "2. Obunyoreze ne Kwozesa",
  "terms_billing_plans_body": "App ya Da-Costa ewa obunyoreze bwa Premium 'Executive Sentry'. Ennyingira eri okuggibwako ku akaawunti yo ya Google Play ng'okugula kukyaliridwa.",
